OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated due to fire in
OL,4,Aderelict building
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated and road
OL,7,Fclosures are in place while
OL,8,Ffirefighters respond to a fire in a
OL,9,Fderelict community building.
OL,11,FEight fire engines are currently at the
OL,12,Fscene of a fire at Sea Mills Community
OL,13,FCentre in Bristol which closed in 2019.
OL,15,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service said some
OL,16,Fnearby properties had been evacuated
OL,17,Fand no injuries had been reported.
OL,19,FTraffic monitoring website Inrix said
OL,20,Fthe A4162 Sylvan Way was closed in both
OL,21,Fdirections due to the fire.
